  "description": "Designed from the start for racing, the Kaius 01 TWO builds on the standard that our Kaius first set for speed on loose ground, bringing more stability, more efficiency, and more confidence at pace.\nAerodynamics are refined through Impec Lab development, leading to a 7% improvement at 40 km/h. The 01 Premium Carbon frame sharpens power transfer while increasing composure over broken ground. Added compliance, 52mm tire clearance and high-speed stability have all been reworked so you can rip the turns and stay aggressive when the racing gets selective.\nFinished with SRAM Force XPLR AXS groupset with full-mount rear derailleur and power meter, it’s a gravel bike ready for race stress. The next-gen ICS Carbon Aero cockpit supports your race position up front, while our CG39 Carbon tubeless-ready wheelset keeps speed high as you glide over the chunky stuff with ease.",
